        "title": "There's a new T. rex from the dinosaur age — and it ruled the seas with a skull-crushing bite",
        "url": "https://www.livescience.com/animals/extinct-species/theres-a-new-t-rex-from-the-dinosaur-age-and-it-ruled-the-seas-with-a-skull-crushing-bite",
        "content_text": "The newly described mosasaur Tylosaurus rex spanned up to 43 feet (13 meters) long and may have been one of the fiercest marine predators of the dinosaur age.",
