        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/10/app-store-connect.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p>Apple alerted developers today to upcoming age rating changes that will affect how apps are classified on the App Store in Australia and Vietnam. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"app-store,apple-developer\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1053094\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/21/apple-to-update-app-store-age-ratings-in-australia-and-vietnam-next-month/#more-1053094\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
