        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/Gemini-Mac-app-summer-26.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"has-text-align-wide\">At I/O 2026, Google previewed two major features for the Gemini app on macOS that are coming this summer.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"gemini,gemini-app\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1053195\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/05/22/gemini-mac-spark-control-summer/#more-1053195\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
