        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/22/ios-26-5-added-new-features-to-three-popular-iphone-apps/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/07/ios-26-app-icons.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>iOS 26.5 launched earlier this month with a variety of <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/04/08/ios-26-5-new-iphone-features/\">brand new features</a> for users. Here are the new iOS 26.5 features that were added to three popular iPhone apps.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ios-26,ios-26-5\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1049641\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/22/ios-26-5-added-new-features-to-three-popular-iphone-apps/#more-1049641\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
