        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/chatgpt-codex.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p>Last week, OpenAI updated ChatGPT for iPhone and iPad <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/14/openai-brings-codex-control-to-chatgpt-for-iphone-and-android/\">with access to Codex</a>, its agentic coding tool for Mac. Since launching, the Codex iOS experience has improved in a few key ways.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ai,apps,codex,openai\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1053007\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/21/openai-improves-codex-ios-experience-with-turn-completion-alerts-new-commands-more/#more-1053007\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
